    "title": "New York Yankees hold moment of silence for Charlie Kirk",
    "text": "I must say I’m surprised, pleasantly surprised by the New York Yankees tonight…. They actually had enough dignity to have a moment of silence to honor Charlie Kirk tonight before their game… Maybe even more amazingly, is that no New Yorkers appeared to boo or make noise during it.. I mean, I know you couldn’t get away with that in Philadelphia, but New York really surprised me tonight on the eve of yet another anniversary of 9/11.\n🚨 BREAKING: The New York Yankees just held a moment of silence for Charlie Kirk prior to their game tonight\nWhat an honor.\nThe world will never forget you, Charlie.\n[pic.twitter.com/tLQomyXrJF]— Nick Sortor (@nicksortor)\n[September 10, 2025]\nThank you so much to the New York Yankees for holding a moment of silence for Charlie tonight. 🙏🏼\n[pic.twitter.com/kwlRMmcz8t]— Ryan Fournier (@RyanAFournier)\n[September 10, 2025]",
